    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_select_01",
      "hash64": "81BF09B554170E22",
      "text": "Ja, bin zum Shoppen hier!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_select_02",
      "hash64": "81BF08B554170C6F",
      "text": "Nein, ich wollte nur Hallo sagen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_02a",
      "hash64": "53EAF8093C36BE9D",
      "text": "Da bist du beim Akademiekiosk genau richtig!\\nHier kriegt man einfach alles.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_02b",
      "hash64": "53EAF5093C36B984",
      "text": "Hahaha, du wolltest mich sehen?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_03",
      "hash64": "5575ADBF491CF7C1",
      "text": "Ich bin eigentlich hergekommen, um einen Blick\\nauf die hiesige Sandwichauswahl zu werfen.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_04",
      "hash64": "5575AEBF491CF974",
      "text": "Die Sandwiches beim Kiosk sind nämlich immer\\nsuperlecker und voller guter Zutaten.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_select_03",
      "hash64": "81BF07B554170ABC",
      "text": "Wollen Sie sie nicht mehr selbst zubereiten?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_select_04",
      "hash64": "81BF06B554170909",
      "text": "Was ist mit Ihrem Spezialtraining?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_05",
      "hash64": "5575AFBF491CFB27",
      "text": "Hahaha! Ich muss zugeben, dass diese Art von\\nTraining für mich sehr ungewohnt und genauso\\r\\nanstrengend war.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_06",
      "hash64": "5575B0BF491CFCDA",
      "text": "Mein Ziel hab ich ja erreicht, deshalb lass ich die\\nKochschürze jetzt erst mal eine Weile ruhen.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_07",
      "hash64": "5575B1BF491CFE8D",
      "text": "Ah, du fragst dich sicher, was für ein Ziel das war.\\nEigentlich wollte ich mich nur bei Señora Mimi\\r\\ndafür revanchieren, dass sie mich so oft verarztet.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 154,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_08",
      "hash64": "5575A2BF491CE510",
      "text": "Ich finde es bewundernswert, wie feinfühlig sie ist\\nund wie geschickt sie mit ihren Patienten umgeht.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_09",
      "hash64": "5575A3BF491CE6C3",
      "text": "Also wollte ich versuchen, mich auf kulinarische\\nWeise bei ihr zu bedanken, aber das war einfach\\r\\nnicht meine Stärke.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_10",
      "hash64": "5578B0BF491F32B1",
      "text": "Stattdessen hab ich beschlossen, mich auf das zu\\nkonzentrieren, was ich gut kann: sportlich und\\r\\nenergiegeladen sein![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_11",
      "hash64": "5578AFBF491F30FE",
      "text": "Im Unterricht hab ich es auch schon mal erwähnt,\\nerinnerst du dich? Für Menschen wie für Pokémon\\r\\ngilt, dass man ihre Stärken fördern sollte![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_12",
      "hash64": "5578AEBF491F2F4B",
      "text": "Danke, dass du mir geholfen hast, diese Lektion\\nnoch einmal zu verinnerlichen! Hier, für dich.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_13",
      "hash64": "5578ADBF491F2D98",
      "text": "So, dann wollen wir mal sehen...\\nWie tanke ich denn heute Proteine?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_d_system_01",
      "hash64": "FDB0D9B2C190B2E5",
      "text": "Señora Amura und du versteht euch nun prächtig!",
